  "blocks": [
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": true,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$y=\\frac{1}{3}x+2$ 和 $y=-0.5x+1$.*"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "第一个函数是增函数，第二个是减函数."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "一般地说，**由式 $y=kx+l$ 给出的函数 $f$，当 $k>0$ 时，**",
        "**$f$ 是增函数；当 $k<0$ 时，$f$ 是减函数.**"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "实际上，设 $x_1$ 和 $x_2$ 是自变量取的两个值，而且 $x_2>x_1$. 要证明：",
        "当 $k>0$ 时，$f(x_2)>f(x_1)$；而当 $k<0$ 时，$f(x_2)<f(x_1)$. 因此，我",
        "们考察 $f(x_2)-f(x_1)$ 的差："
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$f(x_2)-f(x_1)=(kx_2+l)-(kx_1+l)↵=kx_2-kx_1↵=k(x_2-x_1)$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "根据已知条件，$x_2>x_1$，所以因式 $x_2-x_1>0$. 因此，积 $k(x_2-↵x_1)$ 的符号和 $k$ 的符号一致. 如果 $k>0$，那么 $k(x_2-x_1)>0$. 于是，",
        "差 $f(x_2)-f(x_1)$ 是正的，即 $f(x_2)>f(x_1)$，所以函数 $f$ 是增函数."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "如果 $k<0$，那么 $k(x_2-x_1)<0$. 于是，差 $f(x_2)-f(x_1)$ 是负的，",
        "即 $f(x_2)<f(x_1)$，所以这时函数是减函数."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "当 $k=0$ 时，函数 $f$ 只取一个值. 显然，这时函数 $f$ 既不",
        "是增函数，也不是减函数."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "例2 在图50里作出了函数 $y=↵|x|$ 的图象."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "我们看到，在集合 $]-\\infty,0[$ 上函",
        "数减小，而在集合 $]0,+\\infty[$ 上函数增",
        "大."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "fig",
      "label": "图 50",
      "box": [
        984,
        1349,
        365,
        377
      ],
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [],
      "id": "fig-50"
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "不利用图象也可以证明这一事实."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "cap",
      "label": "图 50",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": true,
      "lines": [
        "图50"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": true,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "实际上，如果 $x<0$，那么 $|x|=-x$；如果 $x>0$，那么 $|x|=x$. 因"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "foot",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "* 为了简单起见，以后我们一般只说“函数 $y=f(x)$”，而不说“式 $y=↵f(x)$ 给出的函数”."
      ]
    },
